      "content": "okay but you're being super vague. if the critics are worried about a collapse, they must have some serious evidence or specific models they're looking at, right? like, can you actually lay out those specific arguments for how the economy gets wrecked? just give me the breakdown of the bearish case so i can understand what the actual risks are.",
